WEBVTT

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.170
The touch pools?

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.080
Yeah.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.520
We let the visitors touch sea creatures.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:37.120
The event's been on hiatus, 
since we didn't have enough people,

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.130
but I've always wanted to do it.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:41.270
Hey, Gramps, can we?

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:42.780
Of course.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:44.970
I'll be out of town for work, 
so I won't be able to help.

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:47.800
But you do it every year, 
so you'll be fine.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:48.570
Yeah!

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.410
I'll call you if there's a problem.

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:52.340
And we'll all work on it together!

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.120
All?

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.110
Me, too?

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:58.570
Of course, I was counting
on you, too, Fuuka.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.290
I appreciate it!

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.040
It's a lot of fun!

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:40.440
And that's why the touch pools 
are a big deal during the summer!

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:43.510
Let's get it set up really quickly 
and open by the weekend.

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:44.590
So soon?

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:47.220
It is summer break already.

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:50.250
The summer's going to be over 
if we don't get it together.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:53.230
Kuuya-san, could you handle putting out 
the tanks and the red garra?

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:54.480
'Kay.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.600
Kai, you're welcoming the plants and animals.

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:57.320
Got it.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.100
Welcoming?

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:02.350
We have to collect the plants and animals 
and welcome them to Gama Gama.

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:03.680
Huh.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.700
Fuuka, you can be the attendant, right?

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:08.540
Attendant? Me?

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:09.880
You'll do fine.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:12.540
There aren't that many species 
to remember for the touch pools.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:13.920
You'll have them memorized in no time.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:16.590
Understood.

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:18.400
I'll back you up.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.170
Let me know if you have any questions.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:22.920
Let's all work hard together!

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:24.090
Yeah.

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:27.400
There.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:33.350
<b>Wildlife of Kuroshio</b>

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:36.230
Eat up and get better soon.

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:39.320
<b>touch pools</b>

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:41.580
Huh.

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.980
I never knew so many
aquariums do touch pools.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:45.820
Sea urchins?

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:46.700
Sharks?

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.040
Awesome, huh?

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:51.150
A touch says as much 
as a hundred words.

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:52.330
A touch?

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.150
Yeah.

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:54.810
You can learn more about an animal

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:57.550
by touching it once than you can 
from hearing about it a hundred times.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.130
Sharks are a good example.

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:01.920
That's true. I've heard
about shark skin before,

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.510
but I have only a vague idea 
of what it feels like.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:05.680
Right?

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:09.890
But you can stress the animals out 
if you touch them too carelessly.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:15.710
Little kids are especially rough, 
so the attendant has to pay close attention.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:16.800
Okay!

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:18.030
Is there anything else—

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:19.280
Acting Director?

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:20.800
There's a customer at the shop.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:22.520
Okay, I'm on my way.

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:23.280
What was it?

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.780
No, it's all right.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.690
<i>I have to learn about 
their biology and stuff.</i>

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:39.370
<i>I have to be able to explain things 
to the kids and answer their questions.</i>

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:44.460
This is kind of like...

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:50.140
No.

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:54.060
I need to focus.

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:57.000
Thank you.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:03.440
<b>Moon Jellyfish</b>

00:04:58.370 --> 00:04:59.370
Hey...

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:00.840
About the welcoming.

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.220
You gotta help out.

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:03.440
Huh? Why?

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.920
I don't know what to catch, or how many.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.820
I got in trouble for taking
too much last time. Remember?

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:11.160
Sure.

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:14.980
I was a bit surprised, though.

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:17.170
That you let her do work.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:18.860
Fuuka, you mean?

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:21.420
You were treating her like a newbie 
until just the other day.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:24.700
I just felt like giving
her some responsibilities.

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:27.130
Maybe it's because of this.

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:29.600
A penguin?

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:30.730
First penguins.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.240
We have a matching pair.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.230
So?

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:34.430
So, yeah.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:35.310
What?

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:54.040
I'll see you there.

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:55.750
You're leaving already?

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:59.400
I just had an idea for the touch pools.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:05.420
<b>JB Okinawa</b>

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.340
<b>Multicolor 
Balloons</b>

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:07.340
<b>Crayons</b>

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:17.430
Huh? Red?

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:18.920
They're red.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:24.030
I thought the kids might appreciate 
some bright colors.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:26.170
That was your idea?

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:29.130
You sure are weird.

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.410
Is it weird?

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:31.640
What about those?

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:34.030
I thought kids might like those, too.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.340
Do you have a receipt?

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:36.600
I'll pay for it.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.000
No, I bought these with my own money.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.280
No!

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:42.000
We have to do these things properly.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.000
<b>No wasteful spending!!</b>

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:45.000
Okay.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.010
<b>Touch us gently 
in the water</b>

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.100
<b>Fake coral sets</b>

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:09.340
Hey.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:11.320
I brought Kamee specialty lunch boxes.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:15.200
That's so cute!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.700
Hello!

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:17.790
Where's everyone else?

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.960
We're all getting ready for the touch pools.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.960
Everyone's running around more than usual.

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:23.520
Huh.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.000
Is this part of that, too?

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.460
I thought I'd hand these out to the kids.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.720
That's a good idea!

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.880
Maybe we'll do that at our shop, too.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.260
Do kids come to Kamee?

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:37.230
No, for the people from overseas.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.470
There are more visitors lately.

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:41.060
I bet they'll like origami.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.440
Okay, good luck!

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.360
Thanks.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.990
<b>Blue sea star</b>

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.990
<b>Horned sea star</b>

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.990
<b>Black sea cucumber</b>

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.990
<b>Spider conch</b>

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.990
<b><i>Eriphia sebana</i></b>

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.990
<b>Cushion star</b>

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.990
<b>Sand dollar</b>

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.990
<b><i>Garra rufa</i></b>

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.990
On black sea cucumbers...

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:56.490
When attacked by a predator, 
the black sea cucumber...

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:20.400
Huh?

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:21.370
No way...

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:27.810
Wait!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.310
Stay away!

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.240
No, no, no!

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:34.910
What's wrong?

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.490
Creeper!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.530
Umi-yan?

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:42.720
Guden Gousuke-san. He works here.

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:44.060
We call him "Umi-yan."

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:46.680
Haisai.

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:49.460
This is Miyazawa Fuuka-san. 
She's part-timing here.

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:51.300
I'm sorry!

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:56.560
No, of course you'd be surprised 
if you ran into a giant like me.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:58.500
Yeah...

00:08:59.030 --> 00:08:59.880
No...

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.810
Is your back better, Umi-yan?

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:09.920
Yeah, I thought it was getting better, 
but I think I messed it up again.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:11.650
Are you all right?

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:14.140
I'm fine. I'm fine.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:17.480
Miyazawa Fuuka...

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.070
I knew it!

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.700
Why is she at Gama Gama?

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:29.040
<b>Touch Pool Event</b>

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:34.720
Look at the time.

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:36.870
Are you going to be a while?

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.970
I'm almost done.

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:49.980
Hello!

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:53.260
Huh? You're all here.

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:54.960
Kukuru, do you have a minute?

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:55.690
What?

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.160
It's important.

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.620
Let's take it somewhere else.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.330
Me, too!

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:06.720
Um...

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:08.290
Have a seat.

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:16.040
Want to watch TV?

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:18.750
What did you want to talk about?

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.040
It's about Fuuka-chan.

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:21.870
Is it true that she was an idol?

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:23.920
Huh? How did you know?

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:25.430
Umi-yan intel.

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:28.800
He'll give up eating for his idols.

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:31.790
He won't shut up about
his favorites when he's drunk.

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:33.470
He'll talk my ears off.

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:35.190
Oh yeah, that's right.

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:38.730
Why did Fuuka-chan quit her idol job 
to come to Okinawa?

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:39.870
Why Gama Gama?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:40.960
Dunno.

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:43.330
She hasn't told me much, anyway.

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.800
You don't know, either?

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:48.290
Well that's lame.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:52.540
<b>All-star Quiz</b>

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:51.690
<i>Our next guests are from Yona Pro.</i>

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:53.230
<i>Hello!</i>

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.670
<i>You're all full of life.</i>

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:58.920
Er, the weather tomorrow...

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:02.890
Okay, I'll hand them out 
to our regulars.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.490
I'll take care of promotion.

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:05.560
Thanks.

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:09.020
Good luck at the touch pools, 
Fuuka-chan.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:12.020
<b>Kamee Diner</b>

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:16.020
What's wrong?

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:17.420
Nothing.

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:22.990
<b>Tropical Fish In Boots</b>

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:32.000
So hot...

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:47.640
Oh, there she is.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.610
That's her.

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:51.900
She's looking our way!

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:55.040
You're the new lady here, huh?

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:57.000
Where'd you come from?

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:57.860
Um...

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:01.050
We aren't open yet, old ladies.

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:04.870
They're right. She is pretty.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:04.060
The door was open.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:06.970
She's pretty, huh?

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:07.560
She is.

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:07.870
Um...

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:10.120
We're opening the touch-pool event 
starting tomorrow.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.870
We hope to see you here.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:13.500
Sure thing.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:16.080
Let's bring our grandkids over next time.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.900
We'll be back.

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:20.340
I hope you come to like Gama Gama.

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:21.740
Of course she will.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:24.410
Are you going to survive 
being an attendant?

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:25.630
I'll do my best.

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:27.050
I don't really care,

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:30.680
but you don't seem 
to like fish or anything.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.420
Why are you trying so hard?

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:41.560
How long is that girl staying here?

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.580
She came out of nowhere.

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:45.290
Does that mean 
she'll leave suddenly as well?

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:46.410
Dunno.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.580
I guess she isn't staying here forever, though.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.720
Aren't you going to talk to her about it?

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.560
Isn't that pretty important?

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:59.210
Fuuka doesn't really say 
what's on her mind.

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:02.090
It's hard to tell what she's thinking.

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:04.510
That's what happens 
when you try too hard to be nice.

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:07.760
I told her she doesn't
need to be so nice.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.270
I'm talking about you.

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.800
You're so fast, Kai.

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:14.840
I know.

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:18.900
All right, it's the final stretch 
before the touch pools open!

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:45.630
<b>Touch Pool Rules</b>

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:45.630
<b>Touch us gently 
in the water!</b>

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:45.630
<b>Touch us gently 
in the water!</b>

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:45.630
<b>Wash your hands 
after you touch them!</b>

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.240
We're done!

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:48.480
We finished on time.

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:50.260
The overtime is killing me.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:52.860
It's all thanks to your help.

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:54.120
Thank you.

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:57.640
Now we just need to come in the morning 
and move the water and wildlife in.

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:59.480
I'm counting on you 
starting tomorrow, Fuuka.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:00.980
Right.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:09.490
Do what's right, 
and everything will work out.

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:10.670
Good news!

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:13.490
Umi-yan's coming back
to work starting today!

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.770
I've been waiting for this moment!

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:16.920
I'm finally back.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.050
Looking forward to...

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:22.920
Also, the touch pools
are finally opening today.

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:26.040
We'll make it through the first day together!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:26.890
Yeah!

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:29.260
<b>Touch us gently 
in the water!</b>

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:29.260
<b>Gently <3</b>

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:30.410
Gross!

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:31.890
I can touch these?

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:35.180
Sea creatures are really easy to scare.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:37.360
Touch them gently in the water.

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:38.390
Okay!

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.850
That tickles!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:45.550
Be sure to wash your hands 
after you touch them.

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:46.780
I have gifts for you, too.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.360
Yay!

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:51.040
Good going, Fuuka.

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:52.840
Let's keep it up. We'll kill it.

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:53.680
Okay.

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:56.360
Is it all right if I go check on Choko?

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.450
I'll be all right.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:14:58.820
I'll take care of it.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.290
Kukuru.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:03.400
Udon-chan.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:04.980
And Karin-chan.

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:07.820
We wanted to see 
how Fuuka-chan's doing.

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:09.400
She's super popular.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:11.180
She's inside. 
Go say "hi" to her for me.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.440
Welcome to the summer special touch pools.

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:18.190
<i>Garra rufa</i> are known 
to eat dead cells off your skin.

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:20.270
Would you like to try 
some garra beauty treatments?

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:21.630
What's that?

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:22.860
Sounds fun.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.200
Dude, look!

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:25.690
Is that Miyazawa Fuuka?

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:27.640
Who's that?

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:28.780
She's from Yona Pro.

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:29.950
Formerly.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:32.490
There was a lot of news
online that she'd quit.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:36.230
<i>No. I'm the attendant.</i>

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.120
An idol.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:38.750
Who?

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:39.740
Where's Kukuru?

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:40.710
I'll go get her.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.250
<i>I have to buck up.</i>

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.740
<i>I have to buck up.</i>

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.880
Oh yeah, I should take a picture.

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:48.590
Please...

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:49.590
Please don't!

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:55.000
Please don't take pictures of our staff.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:58.310
You could be accused of taking
non-consensual photos.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:03.980
Fuuka!

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:05.310
I'll take over.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.080
You can go take a break in the back.

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:07.980
But...

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.120
I'll take care of it here.

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.590
You stay with her, Kukuru-chan.

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:14.380
Thanks, Umi-yan.

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:19.870
<b>Poisonous Animals</b>

00:16:15.430 --> 00:16:17.930
Listen up, everyone.

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:19.870
I'm going to teach you a little about crabs.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:22.580
Come in.

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:31.130
I'm sorry.

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:37.220
I never expected anything
like this to happen.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:38.140
Sorry.

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:41.640
Did you not want to be an attendant?

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:46.140
Did I make it hard for you to decline, 
because I was so obsessed with work?

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:48.020
Not at all.

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:53.880
I really wanted the touch pools to work out, 
so that we could keep Gama Gama open.

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:56.510
I got too caught up in my work.

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:58.890
I wasn't paying attention to how you'd feel.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.520
I'm really sorry!

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.040
Please don't apologize.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.440
It's not your fault, Director.

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:08.700
I chose to be an attendant myself.

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:14.060
It's true that I didn't want to be 
in front of people at first.

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:17.850
But after a while, it started
to become fun, and I lost myself in it.

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:24.280
I was really happy when
you gave me work and praised me.

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:27.060
I wanted to be useful to you, Director.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.860
That's why, I...

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:31.860
I see.

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:34.090
That's why I was working so hard.

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:37.480
I wanted to get to know you better.

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:39.910
I wanted to get closer to you.

00:17:40.360 --> 00:17:41.080
That's why...

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:46.920
I never realized you felt that way.

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.020
Me, neither.

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:56.090
I wanted to give you more work,
so that you'd fall in love with Gama Gama more.

00:17:56.610 --> 00:17:57.780
I think...

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:02.350
That's because I wanted 
to become closer to you, too.

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:14.280
You might understand better 
if you touch me.

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:23.670
Do you understand me better?

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:25.540
What about you, Kukuru?

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:30.380
Wait! Did you just call me "Kukuru"?

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:45.310
Crabs use eight of their
ten legs to walk, and—

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:46.570
Hey, are you listening?

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:49.420
You're supposed to touch
the crabs, not the old fart!

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:51.040
Hey, there.

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:54.970
You have to be gentle with
all creatures, land or sea.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.710
Sorry for causing you trouble.

00:18:57.710 --> 00:18:59.880
It's nothing.

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:01.660
Seems that you're all better.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:02.880
Yes.

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.490
As long as Kukuru's with me.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.290
Please let me know 
if you have any questions.

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:15.300
But I'm an attendant, 
so please ask me about sea creatures.

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.640
Me! Me!

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:19.300
Which side of a sea slug is its mouth, 
and which side is its butt?

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:22.920
Sea slugs' mouths and butts are the same.

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.300
Can you believe it?

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:27.310
<b>Welcome to Gama Gama Aquarium</b>

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:33.640
Good work.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:38.340
Sorry for causing such a commotion today.

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:41.200
The thing is...

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:44.200
I was working as an idol until recently.

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:48.840
I mean, I noticed a while ago.

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:53.080
Not to brag, but I can name
everyone in Yona Pro.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:56.090
Umi-yan told us, too.

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:59.090
I never knew.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:01.230
Don't slack off.

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:02.030
Thanks, everyone.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.220
I'm leaving.

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.230
Thank you.

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:07.720
Sorry for keeping you so long, Kai.

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:11.080
I'm looking forward to my paycheck, Director.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.310
Right, Miyazawa-san?

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:16.240
Fuuka, we should go home, too.

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:17.320
Okay!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:26.990
You sure surprised me 
with those red boots, though.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:29.120
Were they really that surprising?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.080
I thought they're cute.

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:32.830
I know!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:34.280
You should wear them, too!

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:35.170
We'll have matching pairs.

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:38.290
Nah, no way.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.000
You'll look good in them!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.440
I won't.

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:43.930
You're the only one who would, Fuuka.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.380
I'm turning out the light.

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:54.280
Good night.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:00.190
<b>Maternity Handbook</b>

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:00.190
<b>Misakino Kukuru</b>

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.220
Good night.

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:18.460
Morning, Fuuka.

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:25.340
We slept in!

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:26.970
I guess it's a change of pace.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:35.980
Kukuru!

00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:16.460
Do you think we'll have
a lot of visitors today?

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:17.500
We will.

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:19.460
We have the awesomest guide.

00:23:20.950 --> 00:23:21.830
Huh?

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:23.910
Is that a guest?

00:23:24.470 --> 00:23:27.590
I'm sorry! We aren't open yet.

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:29.840
Mom?
